#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Wheel force on driving games: centring and cornering\n"
#~ "forces decoded from the game's own drive-board commands,\n"
#~ "plus an impact jolt when you hit something."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Sila na volanu u vožnji: sile centriranja i zavoja\n"
#~ "dekodirane iz naredbi pogonske ploče same igre,\n"
#~ "plus trzaj pri udarcu kad u nešto udarite."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "A gain on every force of the drive board. At 100 %, the\n"
#~ "board's full power (63) gives the wheel's full force, every\n"
#~ "force in proportion. 200 % doubles every force: those above\n"
#~ "half the board's power (32, Sega Rally's strongest torque)\n"
#~ "then saturate."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Pojačanje svih sila pogonske ploče. Na 100 % puna snaga ploče\n"
#~ "(63) daje punu silu volana, svaka sila razmjerno. 200 %\n"
#~ "udvostručuje svaku silu: one iznad pola snage ploče (32,\n"
#~ "najjači moment Sega Rallyja) tada se zasićuju."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "The centring spring of the Sega Rally Championship and\n"
#~ "Daytona USA cabinets: very light, it brings the wheel\n"
#~ "back and is barely felt when held against. A share of\n"
#~ "the resistance above. The other games' cabinets drive\n"
#~ "the wheel with no spring, and ignore this setting."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Opruga za centriranje automata Sega Rally Championship i\n"
#~ "Daytona USA: vrlo lagana, vraća volan i jedva se osjeti\n"
#~ "kad joj se odupire. Udio otpora iznad. Automati ostalih\n"
#~ "igara pokreću volan bez opruge i zanemaruju ovu postavku."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "The motor strength set on the drive board's DIP switches,\n"
#~ "the switches ON counted in binary: 0 = all OFF.\n"
#~ "Sega Rally: switches 1-3, 0 to 7 added to every torque.\n"
#~ "Daytona USA: switches 1-3, 4 times that.\n"
#~ "Indy 500, Touring Car, Over Rev, Super GT 24h:\n"
#~ "switches 1-1 to 1-3, 0 to 7 added to every force."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Snaga motora postavljena DIP prekidačima pogonske ploče,\n"
#~ "prekidači na ON brojeni binarno: 0 = svi OFF.\n"
#~ "Sega Rally: prekidači 1-3, 0 do 7 dodano svakom momentu.\n"
#~ "Daytona USA: prekidači 1-3, četiri puta toliko. Indy 500,\n"
#~ "Touring Car, Over Rev, Super GT 24h: prekidači 1-1 do 1-3,\n"
#~ "0 do 7 dodano svakoj sili."

#, no-c-format
